# Affect Scale Profile

`gmeow:AffectScaleProfile` · Class

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| CURIE | `gmeow:AffectScaleProfile` |
| IRI | `https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectScaleProfile` |
