## Quickstart

```turtle
<subject> a gmeow:AffectScaleProfile ;
    gmeow:metricGram <...> ;  # math:GramMatrix
    gmeow:profileMidpoint "..." ;  # xsd:decimal
    gmeow:profilePolarity <...> ;  # gmeow:ScalePolarity
    gmeow:profileRangeMax "..." ;  # xsd:decimal
    gmeow:profileRangeMin "..." ;  # xsd:decimal
    gmeow:profileTransform "..." ;  # xsd:string
    gmeow:sparseAxisCompletion "..." .  # xsd:boolean
```

